  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Jordan Young Scientist Initiative is based on a tried &#x2013; and &#x2013;true Irish model that was established over 60 years ago and has been successfully replicated in Kenya and Tanzania with the support of the Embassy of Ireland. The primary objective of the initiative,both in Ireland and abroad, is to encourage and promote Science, Technology, Engineering and Mathematics (STEM) &#x2013; based learning among students.</narrative>
